# Balance reports are generated artifacts, and they pile up: one per sim run.
# They are not committed because they do not need to be — the simulator is
# deterministic given a seed prefix, so `npm run sim -- --seeds 1000` regenerates
# the exact report docs/balance.md quotes. The findings live in that document;
# the JSON is the working copy.
sim-reports/
